        en: 'The work may receive revisions, corrections, new editions, presentation updates, editorial adjustments, or formatting improvements. The existence of a future update does not mean that previous versions are invalid, defective, or legally inadequate. When there is a relevant change, it will be handled according to the distribution format and the rules of the official platform used.'
