        en: 'Notices related to misuse, piracy, fake profiles, copyright infringement, purchase issues, support requests, authorization requests, or formal questions must be sent in writing through the official website channels. The communication must contain identification of the sender, basis of the request, relevant documents, links, screenshots, dates, and clear description of the requested measure.'
