        en: 'In cases of piracy, fraud, digital resale, fake pages, improper sharing, reputational attack, or brand and name infringement, evidence should be preserved before requesting removal. Links, screenshots, dates, profile names, amounts charged, messages, receipts, URLs, and platform records may be necessary for technical review, administrative report, or legal measure.'
