        en: 'Purchases, downloads, payments, refunds, deliveries, reviews, comments, reports, and removals may occur on platforms that have their own terms, community policies, marketplace rules, and dispute resolution mechanisms. These rules may coexist with Brazilian law and these guidelines, especially when the platform is operationally responsible for a given stage of the relationship.'
